Copyright 2026 the caml-harness authors.

This product is a re-implementation in OCaml of Harness2 ("Harness²: Recursive Agent
Harnessing for an Open World"), Copyright 2026 Google LLC, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.14224

Changes relative to Harness2: the method core (recursion, budget ledger, harness tree,
leak guards, blind selection, reflection, experience library, scheduling) and the local
demo were rewritten in OCaml; agent evals (src/eval.ml), A2A-shaped agent-to-agent
messaging (src/a2a.ml, src/agents.ml) and a Jev agent seam (src/jev.ml) were added.
scripts/export_prompt.py and scripts/parity.py import an unmodified Harness2 checkout at
runtime and do not redistribute it.

